OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,6,     F1/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,7,     FMendelssohn's early journeys, from
OL,8,     FBerlin salons to Alpine
OL,9,     Fadventures.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FClare Hammond plays live and is
OL,12,     Fjoined by George Vass, ahead of
OL,13,     Fthe Presteigne Festival. Conductor
OL,14,     FCristian Macelaru on his BBC Prom.
OL,15,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,16,     FLive at the BBC Proms: BBC
OL,17,     FNational Orchestra of Wales and
OL,18,     FRyan Bancroft perform with
OL,19,     Fclarinetist Anthony McGill.
